 "note": "Pinout: txu0102 p.4 Figures 6-1..6-3 + Table 6-1 (DCU, DTT, DTM: same numbering); txu0102-q1 p.3 (DCU, DTT, same). Both bits A->B (A1->B1Y, A2->B2Y); OE high enables, low = all outputs Hi-Z (function table txu0102 p.23). OE may be driven from either VCCA or VCCB logic levels (VCC(MIN) circuitry); placed in the VCCA domain. Inputs and OE have weak internal pull-downs.",
